# QA M7 acceptance, BUG (E51 / D-107 as-built (2): the 10 000 /
# „Zaunerstollen!" pair spawns over the plate when she stands, "never
# enters the HUD band"): for a Big or Hackl Resi it does. E51 measured the
# pair for a Normal Resi on the counter (her look 24 px, highest drawn row
# screen y 24, 2 px below the HUD's last row 21). A Big/Hackl look is
# 32 px, so plate and pair sit 8 px higher and the text rises to screen y
# 16-17: it runs into the HUD's ZEIT digits (x 250-314 under „ZEIT").
# Steps: cafe_zauner_boss_win_hackl unchanged (Hackl carried in on the test
# route, the boss beaten with axes, the goal_stollen touched standing at
# 4547, Hackl), then 100 idle frames of the Serve.
# Expected: „Zaunerstollen!" and „10000" stay at screen y >= 22 for the
# whole rise, as for Normal.
# Actual: the pair spawns at once (standing touch) with the text's top
# (outline) at y 32 and rises 16 px; from 4568 to 4577 its top row is
# 21 ... 16, inside the HUD band, over the ZEIT value „161" (shot
# text_in_hud). Every Big/Hackl clear of Stage 9 does this (QA fuzz from
# the beaten boss as Hackl: every touch, standing or in the air); Normal
# never (20 000 fuzz runs). Big shares Hackl's 30 px hitbox and 32 px
# look, so the same geometry applies.
# Fixed in E53 (D-107 "As built (E53)"): the pair's rise stops under the
# HUD (top row 22). Checked on every frame by xtask's
# `stage_9_popups_never_cover_resi_or_reach_the_hud` (popup_clearance.rs);
# the shots are goldens of the fixed frames (art-director review).
level  = hackl
